04:19:00.123 --> 04:19:06.563
<v Clips>So lead 2.4 times the stipulated safe exposure level, nickel 9.6 times safe

04:19:06.563 --> 04:19:09.383
<v Clips>levels, chromium 6.6 times.

04:19:09.523 --> 04:19:14.523
<v Clips>And that's based on safety levels generally recognized in the pharmaceutical industry.

04:19:29.963 --> 04:19:35.303
<v Wolfgang>Wie kann es sein, dass meine Zigaretten stark reglementiert sind?

04:19:35.343 --> 04:19:41.043
